{"bookInfo":{"bookId":"42000000216","bookName":"El día en que dejé de amarte","cover":"https://thwztchapter.dramaboxdb.com/data/cppartner/4x2/42x0/420x0/42000000721/42000000721.jpg@w=360&h=640","viewCount":13351744,"followCount":259082,"introduction":"Tras tres años de matrimonio en los que Diego la despreciaba mientras trataba a su amante como un tesoro, Irene lo soportó todo por amor. Hasta que él viajó al extranjero para sorprender a la otra con fuegos artificiales de 100 mil dólares, mientras ella vendía su anillo para pagar el tratamiento de su padre. Entonces entendió que ese matrimonio ya no lo quería. Pero cuando Diego supo que se había ido, con la voz temblorosa repitió: \"No te dejo. Y no acepto el divorcio.\"","chapterCount":88,"labels":["Love After Divorce","Modern"],"tags":["Love After Divorce","Modern"],"typeTwoIds":[294],"typeTwoNames":["Romántica"],"typeTwoList":[{"id":294,"name":"Romántica","replaceName":"romántica"}],"language":"SPANISH","typeTwoName":"Romántica","simpleLanguage":"es","bookNameEn":"May-We-Never-Meet-Again","bookNameLower":"may-we-never-meet-again","shelfTime":"2025-11-26 18:26:06","firstShelfTime":"2025-11-26 18:26:06","performerList":[{"performerId":"19648","performerName":"Jiaxin Meng","performerFormatName":"Jiaxin-Meng","performerAvatar":"https://hwztchapter.dramaboxdb.com/data/cppartner/8x4/19648/19648.jpg?time=1788407707943","videoCount":8},{"performerId":"19555","performerName":"Xuan Zhang","performerFormatName":"Xuan-Zhang","performerAvatar":"https://hwztchapter.dramaboxdb.com/data/cppartner/5x5/19555/19555.jpg?time=1788407708009","videoCount":4}],"performerIdList":[19555,19648]},"chapterList":[{"id":"700013411","index":0,"unlock":true,"mp4":"https://hwvideoseo.dramaboxdb.com/93/1x2/12x7/127x0/12700000024/700045939_1/700045939.720p.narrowv3.mp4?Expires=1795132800&Signature=Bht8WX61LI725r8icLXmYMDKusnnVwEUIQRtaZ7yo9o-AaFl2zfMQNO9EchA~4h~qp4oJmNX6IdPtQnI8Ty-dqwCQCey7GNEV4kXnOeBBHf70XJnnv-F9hB93ZhpXHQZEAzS~AaKiFkHpa2rP3dm~K2dr~